                                        MessageDigest.getInstance("MD5"))
                                .toString())
                .isEqualTo(expected);
        assertThat(BinaryStringDataUtil.hash(bs("abc"), "MD5").toString()).isEqualTo(expected);

        assertThatThrownBy(() -> BinaryStringDataUtil.hash(bs("abc"), "not-an-algorithm"))
                .isInstanceOf(NoSuchAlgorithmException.class);
    }

    @Test
